'''Slimehill''' is the fourth floor of the [[Deep Caverns]].

{{ZoneText|The &bSlimehill&f can now be traveled to via the Lift Operator.|Mine Emerald ore.|This area is covered with Emerald Slimes!}}

== Features ==
'''Slimehill''' features a few attractions.

=== Lift Operator ===
{{Main|Lift Operator}}
In front of the lift shaft is the {{NPCSprite|Lift Operator}}, who allows players to teleport between layers of the [[Deep Caverns]] with ease. Once the player has entered '''Slimehill''' and talked to the [[Lift Operator]], they will be able to teleport to the floor from any other level of the island.

